  "$comment": "N_buf 2: the client reads only as the case pulls, so its socket is paused through the 2500 ms wait, longer than T_idle (1000 ms). The heartbeats it cannot read while paused would not save it, so a paused stream that counted T_idle would end with code null and resubscribe."
